## Task Classification (12 types)

Kesh assigns one primary class per request (secondary tags allowed):

| Class | Intent |
|-------|--------|
| `EXPLANATION` | How/why something works |
| `INVESTIGATION` | Explore codebase / history without changing it |
| `DEBUGGING` | Symptom → root cause → fix |
| `PATCH` | Small focused change |
| `BUG_FIX` | Correct defective behavior |
| `FEATURE` | New user-visible or API capability |
| `REFACTOR` | Restructure without intended behavior change |
| `ARCHITECTURE` | Design / ADR / system shape |
| `DATABASE_CHANGE` | Schema, migration, data model |
| `SECURITY_CHANGE` | Authn/z, crypto, secrets, vulnerability fix |
| `PRODUCTION_INCIDENT` | Live failure; diagnosis + mitigation |
| `CODE_REVIEW` | Review existing diff/PR only |

### Workflow templates (required / optional)

| Class | Typically required | Often optional | Skip |
|-------|-------------------|----------------|------|
| EXPLANATION | Kesh synthesizes; Sanjaya and/or Vyasa as needed | — | Build/critique/Money Lens |
| INVESTIGATION | Sanjaya; Vyasa if org footprint | Vidura if vague | Parth unless asked |
| DEBUGGING | Sanjaya; Parth; Swachalit regression; Bhishma | Lakshman; Vyasa | Money Lens hard-stop |
| PATCH | Sanjaya (light); Parth; Swachalit; Bhishma | Lakshman; Draupadi | Full Phase-1 architecture unless needed |
| BUG_FIX | Sanjaya; Parth; Swachalit; Bhishma; Lakshman | Vidura if unclear | Money Lens hard-stop |
| FEATURE | Vidura; Sanjaya; Vishwakarma; Sarthi; Parth; Swachalit; Bhishma; Lakshman; Draupadi; Krishna; Money Lens (advisory); Decision Engine; Kripacharya; Kesh | Vyasa | — |
| REFACTOR | Sanjaya; Parth; Swachalit; Bhishma; Lakshman | Vishwakarma if structural | Money Lens hard-stop unless large rewrite |
| ARCHITECTURE | Vidura; Sanjaya; Vishwakarma (+ADR); Krishna; Decision Engine; Kesh | Sarthi; Money Lens advisory | Parth unless implementing |
| DATABASE_CHANGE | Sanjaya; Vishwakarma; Parth; Swachalit; Bhishma; Lakshman; standards/database/** | Draupadi | Unapproved destructive DDL |
| SECURITY_CHANGE | Threat notes; Parth; Swachalit; Bhishma; scanners if available | Krishna | Money Lens hard-stop |
| PRODUCTION_INCIDENT | Evidence collection; Sanjaya; mitigation plan; human approval for consequential acts | Parth for approved fix | Money Lens hard-stop; no silent prod changes |
| CODE_REVIEW | Bhishma; Lakshman; Draupadi | Krishna | Parth/Swachalit unless fix requested |

Load matching `rules/standards/**` via globs / explicit reference for the stack in play.

