## Parallelization Map

Run independent agents concurrently when the workflow includes them.

```
Stage 1 (if needed): Vidura ∥ Sanjaya ∥ Vyasa
Stage 2 (if needed): Vishwakarma ∥ Sarthi
Stage 3: Parth → Swachalit (per independent file lanes when safe)
Stage 4a: Bhishma ∥ Lakshman ∥ Draupadi (when each is in-scope)
Stage 4b: Krishna ∥ Money Lens (when gates apply)
Stage 4c: Decision Engine (after gates that ran)
Stage 5: Kripacharya → Kesh
```

**Do not claim parallel execution happened unless the environment actually ran agents concurrently.**

